er-open","Equations","/group/foundations/equations/","\n        A comprehensive overview of quadratic equations, including quadratic trinomials, completing the square,\n        the discriminant, Vieta’s formulas, factoring, real-life applications, and even methods for solving them mentally.\n    ","content/01-foundations/02-equations/02-quadratic/decoration.svg",{"materials":160,"elements":161},1,{"accent_term":162,"accent_important":160,"problem":163},2,5,{"hardDependencies":165,"autoDependencies":172,"externals":175},[166],{"type":167,"contentType":168,"title":169,"link":170,"reason":171},"hard","topic","Elementary Equations","/article/foundations/equations/elementary/","Before solving quadratic equations, you must be able to solve elementary ones. There is no other way. Don't even try.",[173],{"type":174,"contentType":168,"title":169,"link":170},"auto",[176],{"type":177,"title":9,"items":178},"parent",[179],{"type":180,"title":181,"info":182,"link":183,"reason":184},"web","LibreTexts Mathematics","An open and free online collection of mathematics educational materials.","https://math.libretexts.org/","A large amount of materials and many typical practice problems.",[186],{"contributorId":187,"name":188,"avatarUrl":189},"gwynerva","Peter Radko","/file/contributors/gwynerva/avatar.png","group",[192],{"type":168,"link":193,"title":194,"description":195,"quickLinks":196,"stats":218},"/article/foundations/equations/quadratic/what-is-it/","What is it?","\n        Learn what a quadratic equation and a quadratic trinomial are, how they are related, and how to determine whether an equation is quadratic.\n    ",[197,204,212],{"link":198,"schemaName":199,"title":200,"quick":201,"seo":202,"description":203},"/article/foundations/equations/quadratic/what-is-it/#problematic-equations","problems","Quadratic equations in real life",{},{},"Examples of various real-life situations that boil down to quadratic equations.\n                    This will make it clear why we need to be